==Phylogeny and Taxonomy==

Blastozoan phylogeny is an active area of research with little consensus regarding the monophyly of or relationships among the traditional Linnaean classes.  However, recent research suggests that the parablastoids are the sister group to the [[Asteroblastida]], one of the three traditional orders within the polypheletic traditional class [[Diploporita]] as shown in the following cladogram simplified from Sheffield and Sumrall (2019):

